════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  [Pretrain / nanochatGPT]
  cuBLAS math mode : CUBLAS_DEFAULT_MATH
  cuBLAS compute   : CUBLAS_COMPUTE_32F
  Weight dtype     : FP16  (BF16 requires SM≥8.0 — NOT available here)
  Master weights   : FP32  (mandatory for gradient stability)
  Optimizer m/v    : FP16 + loss scaling (2x memory saving vs FP32 Adam)
  Activations      : FP16

  // Rust / CUDA:
  // cublasGemmEx: use CUBLAS_COMPUTE_32F — NOT 16F (gives BAD results!)

