  ❌ AVOID on SM 6.1:
     BF16     — not supported (requires SM≥8.0 / Ampere)
     TF32     — not supported (requires SM≥8.0)
     FP8      — not supported (requires SM≥8.9 / Ada)
     Q4_1/Q5_1 — legacy, no dp4a MMQ path, worse than K-quants
     Q2_K     — use IQ2_M instead (better quality same size)
     IQ1_S    — no CUDA kernel, CPU-only, severe quality degradation

  ★ Pareto frontier (speed × quality × VRAM):
     VRAM = 8GB:  IQ4_XS > Q4_K_M > IQ3_M (Q8_0 too large for 7B)

